{"availability":"available","full":"Hussain004/BAGEL","name":"BAGEL","description":"ROS Bag Visualizer","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":50,"forks":5,"created":"2026-05-22T07:29:28Z","updated":"2026-10-08T18:18:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bagel-ros2.vercel.app","topics":["foxglove","gaussian-splatting","point-cloud","react","robotics","ros","ros2","rosbag","threejs","typescript","urdf","visualization"],"demo":"https://bagel-ros2.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:09.981Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:09.981Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:09.981Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","stars":49,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-04T10:32:25.063Z","stars":49,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:31:27.253Z","stars":49,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:09:09.981Z","stars":50,"forks":5}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Explore ROS1 & ROS2 bag files in your browser. No installation required.","BAGEL is a fully static web application that lets you explore ROS bag files (.mcap, .db3, .bag), standalone point cloud files (.pcd, .ply), and 3D Gaussian Splat scenes (.ply, .splat, .ksplat) entirely in your browser needing no server, no installation, no account. Just drag and drop!","Robotics engineers and researchers frequently generate bag files during experiments, SLAM runs, and sensor calibration. Inspecting these files currently requires a full ROS1 or ROS2 installation, Foxglove Studio (increasingly commercial), or writing custom Python scripts for every inspection task."],"features":["A condensed feature list is below. Detailed version-by-version release notes (with the design rationale behind every feature) live in FEATURES.md.","TimeSeriesPlot: chart any numeric leaf field (linear.x, orientation.w, etc.) on uPlot. Math expressions as derived series: type fielda 2 + fieldb in the series editor to plot any arithmetic combination of fields from…","ImageViewer: sensormsgs/Image (rgb8 / bgr8 / rgba8 / mono8 / mono16) and CompressedImage (jpeg / png) with lazy single-message reads. Foxglove equivalents (foxglove.RawImage, foxglove.CompressedImage) supported via JSON…","ThreeDScene (Three.js): PointCloud2, LaserScan, MarkerArray (all twelve primitives: CUBE / SPHERE / CYLINDER / ARROW / LINESTRIP / LINELIST / CUBELIST / SPHERELIST / POINTS / TEXTVIEWFACING / MESHRESOURCE / TRIANGLELIST…","Spatial topic layers (v1.7.1): Open any 3D panel, then use Display > Overlays > scene topics to add maps, point clouds, laser scans, and odometry or pose topics to the same TF-aligned scene. This supports workflows such…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hussain004/BAGEL/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d972095f84e3d4db96df084a1d10d9dac82c5f7f2e57b7294deb1e1e79d0f541","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:12:49.995Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:12:49.995Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Explore ROS1 & ROS2 bag files in your browser. No installation required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hussain004/BAGEL/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"BAGEL is a fully static web application that lets you explore ROS bag files (.mcap, .db3, .bag), standalone point cloud files (.pcd, .ply), and 3D Gaussian Splat scenes (.ply, .splat, .ksplat) entirely in your browser needing no server, no installation, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hussain004/BAGEL/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d972095f84e3d4db96df084a1d10d9dac82c5f7f2e57b7294deb1e1e79d0f541","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hussain004/BAGEL/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:12:49.997Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T18:18:49Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:12:48.067Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hussain004/BAGEL/blob